#: contents/ui/KdeConnectPanel.qml:1009
msgid ""
"See your phone's battery, files and notifications right in the Start menu, "
"thanks to KDE Connect."
msgstr ""
"Batterij, bestanden en meldingen van uw telefoon direct in het Startmenu, "
"dankzij KDE Connect."

